From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8350-b2q: fast wireless charging

Stock's CV and full foreign object detection gains (fod_list pad_0x00)
and its input limits on a Samsung fast wireless pad: 600 mA at 10 V
(HV_WIRELESS), 500 mA until then (PREPARE_WIRELESS_HV).

Signed-off-by: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
index 27ee9ca..f694d25 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
@@ -423,11 +423,21 @@
 			pinctrl-0 = <&wpc_det_state &mfc_int_state &wpc_en_state>;
 			pinctrl-names = "default";
 
-			/* stock fod_list pad_0x00 cc */
+			/* stock fod_list pad_0x00 cc, cv and full */
 			idt,fod = /bits/ 8 <0x96 0x3e 0x8e 0x37 0x96 0x2e
 					    0x96 0x31 0xaa 0x03 0x9c 0x42>;
+			idt,fod-cv = /bits/ 8 <0x96 0x5c 0x8e 0x55 0x96 0x4c
+					       0x96 0x4f 0xaa 0x21 0x9c 0x60>;
+			idt,fod-full = /bits/ 8 <0xff 0x7f 0xff 0x7f 0xff 0x7f
+						 0xff 0x7f 0xff 0x7f 0xff 0x7f>;
 			/* cable-info WIRELESS (Qi BPP, PMA, stands): 800 mA in */
 			idt,bpp-input-current-microamp = <800000>;
+			/*
+			 * HV_WIRELESS (Samsung fast wireless, 10 V): 600 mA;
+			 * PREPARE_WIRELESS_HV, until 10 V: 500 mA
+			 */
+			idt,hv-input-current-microamp = <600000>;
+			idt,hv-prepare-input-current-microamp = <500000>;
 
 			/* the charger's UNO boost powers it to transmit */
 			uno-supply = <&max77705_uno>;
